You're on a cliff path, high above the shore. [[Climb down to the beach]](beach)

[[beach]]:
@music sea.mp3
Waves roll in across the sand. There's a dark cave at the foot of the cliff. [[Go into the cave]](cave)

[[cave]]:
@music stop
@sound snuffle.mp3
Something sniffs at you in the dark. [[Run back outside]](outside)

[[outside]]:
@music sea.mp3
Daylight, and the sound of the sea again.
